<title>USA: Excel,Telco deal greeted with Wall St rally.</title>
<headline>Excel,Telco deal greeted with Wall St rally.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Communications Inc's $1.2 billion pact to acquire Telco Communications Group Inc sparked a rally in both stocks Friday as investors liked the prospect of a new heavyweight in the long-distance telephone  market, traders and arbitrageurs said.</p>
<p>&quot;That is just a great show. It is so rare that you see both stocks (of a merger agreement) act so well,&quot; said an arbitrageur who declined to be identified.</p>
</text>
